00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:45,640
 It shows you the posterior muscles of the wrist and fingers.

603
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:49,320
 This other one, this is a continuation of part B.

604
00:23:49,320 --> 00:23:53,240
 This one goes over the extensor carb by Radialis Longus.

605
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:56,680
 This goes over the extensor carb by Radialis Brevis.

606
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:58,800
 And this one goes over the extensor Digitorum.

607
00:23:58,800 --> 00:24:05,040
 And we have the extensor carb by Oneris over here.

608
00:24:05,040 --> 00:24:07,360
 So be sure that you view all these animations

