00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:37,800
 showing you the forearm, so the posterior compartment

731
00:29:37,800 --> 00:29:41,280
 of the forearm and it's responsible for extending

732
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:42,560
 the wrist and fingers.

733
00:29:42,560 --> 00:29:44,640
 And it's innervated by the radial nerve.

734
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:46,960
 So you can see the extensors over here.

