00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:56,680
 So this flexes the wrist and the fingers.

739
00:29:56,680 --> 00:30:00,960
 And it's innervated by the median or the ulnar nerve.

740
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:03,400
 So when you look at these muscles over here,

741
